  <!-- EN: <color=#9f40ff>Talent: Adventurer</color> -->
  <RT_TalentAdventurer.degreeDatas.color9f40ffTalent_Adventurercolor.label>&lt;color=#9f40ff>冒险家&lt;/color></RT_TalentAdventurer.degreeDatas.color9f40ffTalent_Adventurercolor.label>
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] is a skilled fighter. [PAWN_pronoun] realised that [PAWN_pronoun] could protect [PAWN_possessive] friends and satisfy [PAWN_possessive] curiosity at the same time. -->
  <RT_TalentAdventurer.degreeDatas.color9f40ffTalent_Adventurercolor.description>[PAWN_nameDef]因为经常冒险成为了一名老练的战士。[PAWN_nameDef]意识到[PAWN_pronoun]可以保护[PAWN_possessive]朋友，同时满足[PAWN_possessive]好奇心。</RT_TalentAdventurer.degreeDatas.color9f40ffTalent_Adventurercolor.description>
  
  <!-- EN: <color=#9f40ff>Talent: Architect</color> -->
  <RT_TalentArchitect.degreeDatas.color9f40ffTalent_Architectcolor.label>&lt;color=#9f40ff>建筑师&lt;/color></RT_TalentArchitect.degreeDatas.color9f40ffTalent_Architectcolor.label>
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] is an architect. [PAWN_pronoun] understands that you don't have to be in The Good Place to build The Good Place. -->
  <RT_TalentArchitect.degreeDatas.color9f40ffTalent_Architectcolor.description>[PAWN_nameDef]是一名建筑师。[PAWN_pronoun]明白，你不一定要在好地方才能建造好房子。</RT_TalentArchitect.degreeDatas.color9f40ffTalent_Architectcolor.description>
  
